<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro allows you to edit very quickly on the key of F. all you have to do is go to the keyran main screen and bind (find edit [F] with any free key on your keyboard you want to use and your fast edit, this can be any key. If you have problems with the macro, write to me, I will help you.
To make this macro work, you need to bind it to any key and that's it, you're done!</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 9 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 36 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 36 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 9 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 9 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>